;;; =====================================================================
;;; STAGE 7.  SIX FACTS ABOUT max AND min.
;;;
;;; These belong in rr-max-basics.scm / rr-min-basics.scm and are here only
;;; because this batch adds NEW files only; they are stated in those files'
;;; style and would move without a change.  `rr-max-def' / `rr-min-def' give
;;; the value only under the ORIENTED guard (`y <= x implies max(x, y) = x'),
